<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL-3Com, networking shrs firm.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL-3Com, networking shrs firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Com Corp and other computer networking shares rallied preceding Friday's market open on 3Com's announcement last night of stronger-than-expected quarterly results, traders said.</p>
<p>3Com stock climbed to 79-1/2 from 76-3/4 before the opening bell, threatening the year-high 81-3/4, while Cisco Systems added 1-1/8 to 66-1/8.</p>
<p>3Com second quarter profit from operations increased 71 percent on strong sales while profits before acquisition charges surged to $112.2 million, or $0.60 a share.</p>
<p>3Com netted $65.6 million, or $0.37 per share, last year.</p>
